## The home

home_title = Your own cookbook
home_text = Keep the recipes you cook, written by hand or imported from the sites you like, compose your dishes, plan your week and leave with the groceries it takes.
home_features_title = Everything starts from your recipes
home_recipes_title = Your recipes
home_recipes_text = Write them by hand, or import them from the sites you like: imkitchen reads the page and keeps the recipe, its ingredients, its steps and its picture.
home_dishes_title = Your dishes
home_dishes_text = Put your recipes together into the dishes you serve: a dish is planned and cooked as a whole.
home_list_title = Your list
home_list_text = Have the list of the week generated from your dishes and your recipes, or choose each recipe yourself. It changes as your week does.
home_groceries_title = Your groceries
home_groceries_text = The ingredients of your list, added up into one list of groceries. Tick what is in the basket, adjust a quantity.
home_start_title = Guided from the first recipe
home_start_text = A tutorial walks you through it: create or import a recipe, compose a dish, say how you like your list, generate it and leave with the groceries.
