terms_meta_title = Terms of use — imkitchen
terms_description = The terms imkitchen is used under: your account, your content, what is expected of you and of us.
terms_title = Terms of use
terms_intro = In short: your recipes are yours, and imkitchen keeps them for you and for nobody else. The careful version follows.
terms_agreement_title = The agreement
terms_agreement_1 = These terms are the agreement between you and Timada, which publishes imkitchen (“we”), for the use of the imkitchen application and of this site (“the service”).
terms_agreement_2 = Creating an account means you accept them. You must be at least 13 years old to use imkitchen, or older where the law of your country asks for it.
terms_account_title = Your account
terms_account_1 = An account is opened with an email address, proven with a code we mail to it. Give an address you read: it is how you get back in.
terms_account_2 = An account is for one person. Keep your password to yourself: what is done from your account is yours to answer for. If you believe someone else got in, change your password and write to us.
terms_content_title = Your content
terms_content_1 = Your recipes, their pictures, your dishes, your list and your groceries are yours. We claim no right over them.
terms_content_2 = You allow us to store them and to display them to you, on your devices, for the only purpose of running the service. Nobody else reads them. We do not sell them, hand them to anyone or train AI models on them.
terms_import_title = Imported recipes
terms_import_1 = When you import a recipe, imkitchen reads the page whose address you give and keeps a copy of the recipe in your account, for your own use.
terms_import_2 = The recipe remains the work of its author. It is up to you to import only what you may keep a personal copy of.
terms_use_title = Acceptable use
terms_use_1 = Do not use imkitchen to keep unlawful content, to get into an account that is not yours, to disturb the service or to read it by automated means beyond your own account.
terms_use_2 = An account that breaks these rules may be suspended or closed.
terms_property_title = What is ours
terms_property_1 = The application, this site, their code, their design and the imkitchen name belong to Timada. You may use them as they are meant to be used; you may not copy, resell or rebrand them without our written agreement.
terms_warranty_title = What imkitchen is not
terms_warranty_1 = imkitchen gives no medical, dietary or allergy advice. Read the labels of what you buy, and ask a professional when your health is at stake.
terms_warranty_2 = The service is provided as it is. We work to keep it available and your content safe, but we cannot promise it never fails or stops.
terms_liability_title = Liability
terms_liability_1 = As far as the law allows, we are not liable for indirect damage arising from the use of the service or from it being unavailable. Nothing here takes away the rights the law gives you as a consumer.
terms_closing_title = Closing your account
terms_closing_1 = You can stop using imkitchen at any time. Write to us to have your account closed: it is deleted, with everything it holds, within 30 days.
terms_changes_title = Changes
terms_changes_1 = These terms may change. When a change matters, we tell you by email before it applies.
terms_law_title = Applicable law
terms_law_1 = These terms are governed by French law. Write to us first if something goes wrong: most things are settled that way. Failing that, the French courts have jurisdiction, subject to the rules that protect consumers.
terms_publisher_title = Who publishes imkitchen
terms_publisher_1 = What the law asks a site to say about its publisher and its host.
