privacy_meta_title = Privacy — imkitchen
privacy_description = What imkitchen keeps about you, what it is used for and how to have it corrected or deleted.
privacy_title = Privacy
privacy_intro = In short: imkitchen keeps what it takes to run your cookbook, and nothing to follow you. This site sets no cookie and measures no visit.
privacy_controller_title = Who is responsible
privacy_controller_1 = Timada, which publishes imkitchen, is responsible for the data described here. Its details are at the end of the terms of use.
privacy_data_title = What is kept
privacy_data_1 = Your account: your email address, the name you give, your password in a form that cannot be read back, and the language you read.
privacy_data_2 = Your content: your recipes and their pictures, your dishes, your list, your groceries and your settings.
privacy_data_3 = Your sessions: when you signed in, and the browser or the application you signed in from.
privacy_data_4 = Your messages: when you write to us from the contact page, your name, your address and what you wrote.
privacy_use_title = What it is used for
privacy_use_1 = To run the service: show you your cookbook on your devices, generate your list, add up your groceries and mail you the codes that prove your address.
privacy_use_2 = Nothing else: no profiling, no audience measurement, no mail you did not ask for.
privacy_site_title = This site
privacy_site_1 = The pages of this site set no cookie, load no script and nothing from another site, and report no visit to anyone.
privacy_others_title = Who else sees it
privacy_others_1 = Nobody reads your content but you. We do not sell your data, and do not hand it to anyone for a use of their own.
privacy_others_2 = Two providers handle it on our behalf and on our instructions: the host of our servers (OVHcloud, in France) and the service that delivers our emails. We may also have to answer a lawful request from an authority.
privacy_retention_title = How long
privacy_retention_1 = As long as your account exists. Once it is closed, the account and its content are deleted within 30 days.
privacy_rights_title = Your rights
privacy_rights_1 = You may ask for a copy of your data, have it corrected or deleted, and object to its use or have it restricted, as the General Data Protection Regulation provides. Write to { $email }: we answer within a month.
privacy_rights_2 = If our answer does not satisfy you, you may complain to the data protection authority of your country: in France, the CNIL.
privacy_security_title = Security
privacy_security_1 = Connections to imkitchen are encrypted. Neither your password nor the tokens of your sessions are kept in a form that can be read back.
privacy_children_title = Children
privacy_children_1 = imkitchen is not meant for children under 13, and we do not knowingly keep data about them.
privacy_changes_title = Changes
privacy_changes_1 = This page may change. When a change matters, we tell you by email before it applies.

